<!--
  A recording, for the day timeline. Drawn for this app rather than taken from the SDK set, which
  has no microphone and no tape in it, but to the same rules: a 30-unit viewport, filled paths, no
  stroke, recognisable at about twelve pixels.

  A cassette rather than a microphone. A mic silhouette at this size is a lollipop and reads as
  anything at all; two reels inside a rounded box is a shape nothing else in this app has, which is
  the only property an icon in a list of eight glyph types actually needs.
-->
